{"id":"613136","name":"青菜香菇馅饼","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/613136/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"300g"},{"name":"60度温开水","amount":"75克"},{"name":"冷水","amount":"75g"}],"sub":[{"name":"上海青","amount":"400g"},{"name":"香菇","amount":"100g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"青菜洗净焯水沥干。","img":"images/613136/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"香菇焯水沥干。","img":"images/613136/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"香菇青菜剁碎，加盐，鸡精搅匀，再放植物搅匀。","img":"images/613136/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"克面粉加75克温开水搅拌成絮状，揉成面团。","img":"images/613136/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"另150克面粉加75克冷水搅拌成絮状，揉成面团。","img":"images/613136/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"两个面团再混合在一起，揉成一个面团。醒三十分钟。","img":"images/613136/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"面团醒好","img":"images/613136/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"擀成长条，切成30克左右的剂子。","img":"images/613136/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"擀成薄薄的面皮，放上馅料。","img":"images/613136/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再盖上一张面皮。","img":"images/613136/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"四周捏紧。","img":"images/613136/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"不粘锅预热，放油。中火煎。","img":"images/613136/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"两面煎黄，煎熟。","img":"images/613136/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/613136/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}